  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「いやぁ大変だった！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「海でちょっと遠泳しすぎたかな〜、とはうすうす感づいてたんだけどな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「まさか無人島に流れ着くなんて、思ってもなかっただろう？　そうは思わないか、転校生くん？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「波にさらわれて、男女二人きりで無人島！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「不純なことが起きないはずがない！　……と、少しは警戒したんだけどな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「どうやら転校生くんは、私に女としての魅力を感じていないようだ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「というかむしろ、ただのうるさい動物とくらいにしか思っていないということがわかったぞ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「……そんなことないって？　かわいい奴だな〜、転校生くんは！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「よしよししてやろう！　頭をなでてやるからな〜？　ほら、よしよし！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「……そう嫌がらなくても、いいじゃないか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「たしかに、髪をぐしゃぐしゃにしてしまうから、春風団員にこれをやると怒られるんだけどな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「しかし、転校生くんは男の子だ！　たしょう髪型を乱されたくらいでどうこう言う性格でもないだろう！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「……え？　もしかして気にするタイプなのか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「ちょっと待った、露骨に嫌そうな顔をしないでくれ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「この島には私と転校生くんのふたりしかいないんだ、仲良くしようじゃないか！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「ここに来る前に、転校生くんがサンオイルを塗ってくれたこと、私は忘れないぞ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「さあさあ！　ふたりで親睦を深めよう♪　もう魚が焼けてるぞ〜？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「無人島に来て早々に巨大魚を捕まえるなんて、転校生くんは流石だと思う！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「この骨飾りも作ってもらったしな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「私はとても足手まといになっているみたいだけど、そんなこと気にしない☆」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 24,
    "dress": "old-abo",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-abo_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 494
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「だけどせめて、私が転校生くんのお世話をさせてもらうから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「ほら、魚もいい具合に焼けてるぞ？　とてもいい香りが漂っている！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ましろ",
    "text": "「転校生くんが、木を削って箸も作ってくれたからな？　さっそく有効活用させてもらうぞ！」"
